{"availability":"available","full":"richardtallent/vue-simple-calendar","name":"vue-simple-calendar","description":"Simple Vue component to show a month-grid calendar with events","category":"Productivity","language":"Vue","stars":935,"forks":158,"created":"2017-05-10T22:08:01Z","updated":"2026-04-17T21:31:02Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://www.tallent.us/vue-simple-calendar/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T17:58:48.077Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T17:58:48.077Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T17:58:48.077Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:32:35.512Z","stars":935,"forks":158},{"at":"2026-10-07T23:30:02.752Z","stars":935,"forks":158},{"at":"2026-10-09T17:58:48.077Z","stars":935,"forks":158}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["vue-simple-calendar is a flexible, themeable, lightweight calendar component for Vue that supports multi-day scheduled items.","Important: Version 6.0, released 2021-03-27, dropped IE11 support and was migrated to Vue 3 and Vite. Version 5 is still is available via npm if you need Vue 2 or IE11 support, but it will not be maintained going forward.","Because Vue is awesome. I've been using it since early 2017 in production, and I've migrated my applications from ExtJS, JQuery, and Riot to Vue components. If you prefer React or Angular, it should be reasonably easy to port it. If you do, please let me know, maybe we can coordinate on feature upgrades!"],"features":["There are other great calendar components out there, but most are either intended to be used as date pickers or had way too many features for me. I wanted something that would simply show a month as a grid and show…","Shows a traditional month-grid calendar. Also supports weeks, years, or multiple weeks, months, or years.","Can show scheduled \"items,\" including multi-day items, with an optional time of day.","If there are too many items to see in a week, you can scroll to see the others.","If there are too many weeks to see in the calendar component, you can scroll to see the others."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/richardtallent/vue-simple-calendar/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c0026220c1272b0bd50c53e8f0b4995869b5c7ff4521fcd60f6c1863aef0823c","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:35.623Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T17:58:48.077Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"vue-simple-calendar is a flexible, themeable, lightweight calendar component for Vue that supports multi-day scheduled items.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/richardtallent/vue-simple-calendar/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c0026220c1272b0bd50c53e8f0b4995869b5c7ff4521fcd60f6c1863aef0823c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/richardtallent/vue-simple-calendar/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T17:58:48.077Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-04-17T21:31:02Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/richardtallent/vue-simple-calendar/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T17:58:48.077Z","hash":"c0026220c1272b0bd50c53e8f0b4995869b5c7ff4521fcd60f6c1863aef0823c","originalBytes":38791,"storedBytes":38791,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["calendar","item","date","week","items","day","default","user","component","when","optional","css","header","month","time","using","classes","each","show","div","class","number","one","would","period","note","shown","slot","added","current","first","vue","want","there","dates","events","item.","need","other","theme","add","days","etc.","example","fires","should","some","value","windowevent","button","defaults","element","only","style","these","used","within","any","displayperiodcount","displayperioduom","may","periodstart","property","weeks","calendaritem","change","height","just","properties","range","same","see","set","string","true","week.","where","year","allow","event","future","last","locale","name","new","over","own","parent